  <p>Planning a trip to the world's smallest republic? You're in for a unique adventure. Nauru offers something genuinely different — pristine coral reefs, fascinating history, warm Pacific hospitality, and the kind of off-the-beaten-path experience that's increasingly rare in our globalised world.</p>

